---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {FIELD_GROUPS,STAGES} from '../../../lib/deal-workspace.mjs';
import '../../../styles/deal-workspace.css';
const fieldGroups=FIELD_GROUPS as {id:string;label:string;fields:{path:string;label:string;type:'text'|'textarea'|'number'|'select';max?:number;min?:number;options?:Record<string,string>}[]}[];
---
<Base title="Deal Workspace" description="Keep sanitized acquisition facts, evidence gaps, questions and next actions together." type="AI Deal Lab" workspace analytics={false}>
 <div class="deal-workspace" data-deal-workspace data-pagefind-ignore>
  <header class="workspace-topbar"><a class="workspace-brand" href="/ai/"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">AC</span> AI Deal Lab <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Deal Workspace</a><nav aria-label="Workspace navigation"><a href="/ai/call-coach/">Standalone Seller Call Coach</a><a href="/account/">Account &amp; usage</a></nav></header>
  <header class="workspace-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Acquisition tracking</p><h1>Deal Workspace</h1><p>Organize what you have heard, what needs evidence and what to ask next.</p></div><span class="workspace-tag">Browser local · No uploads</span></header>
  <p class="workspace-boundary"><strong>Use short, sanitized summaries only.</strong> Do not enter confidential, proprietary, personal or non-public material. Use fictional or public information. Claims and evidence statuses are your reports, never AI verification. <a href="/privacy/#ai-deal-lab">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>.</p>
  <div class="workspace-access" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span data-workspace-status>Checking paid access…</span> <button type="button" class="workspace-text-button" data-workspace-retry hidden>Retry access check</button><span data-workspace-access-links hidden> <a href="/account/">Sign in / account</a> · <a href="/pricing/">View plans</a></span></div>
  <p class="workspace-error" data-workspace-error role="alert" hidden></p>
  <div data-workspace-content hidden>
   <section class="workspace-dealbar" aria-label="Deal selection"><div class="workspace-select"><label for="workspace-deal">Selected deal</label><select id="workspace-deal" data-deal-select></select></div><div class="workspace-select stage-select"><label for="workspace-stage">Stage</label><select id="workspace-stage" data-deal-stage>{Object.entries(STAGES).map(([value,label])=><option value={value}>{label}</option>)}</select></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-new-deal>New deal</button><button type="button" class="workspace-text-button danger" data-delete-deal>Delete deal</button><span class="small" data-deal-count></span></section>
   <div class="workspace-savebar"><label class="workspace-check"><input type="checkbox" data-save-local /> Save this deal in this browser</label><span class="small" data-save-status>Page memory only</span><span class="small workspace-dates" data-deal-dates></span></div>
   <p class="workspace-save-warning small">Browser saves are shared with anyone using this browser profile, are not encrypted or synced, and are lost if site data is cleared. Default page-memory deals disappear when you leave or reload.</p>
   <div class="workspace-layout">
    <div class="workspace-main">
     <div class="workspace-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Deal workspace sections">{[['overview','Overview'],['claims','Facts & claims'],['evidence','Evidence'],['questions','Questions'],['actions','Next actions']].map(([id,label],i)=><button type="button" id={`workspace-tab-${id}`} role="tab" aria-selected={i===0?'true':'false'} aria-controls={`workspace-panel-${id}`} tabindex={i===0?0:-1} data-workspace-tab={id}>{label}<span data-tab-count={id}></span></button>)}</div>
     <section id="workspace-panel-overview" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="workspace-tab-overview" data-workspace-panel="overview" class="workspace-panel">
      <div class="workspace-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start with what you know</p><h2>Deal overview</h2></div><span class="small">Every field is optional</span></div><p class="small">A deal alias and a few headline numbers are enough to begin. Open a section when you have more to add.</p>
      <div class="workspace-field"><label for="workspace-alias">Deal alias</label><input id="workspace-alias" data-field="alias" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="workspace-alias-help" /><p class="small" id="workspace-alias-help">Use a project alias, not a legal company or personal name.</p></div>
      {fieldGroups.map((group,i)=><details class="workspace-field-group" open={i===0}><summary>{group.label}</summary><div class="workspace-fields">{group.fields.filter(field=>field.path!=='alias'&&field.path!=='stage').map(field=><div class:list={['workspace-field',{'field-wide':field.type==='textarea'}]}><label for={`workspace-field-${field.path.replaceAll('.','-')}`}>{field.label}</label>{field.type==='select'?<select id={`workspace-field-${field.path.replaceAll('.','-')}`} data-field={field.path}>{Object.entries(field.options||{}).map(([value,label])=><option value={value}>{label}</option>)}</select>:field.type==='textarea'?<textarea id={`workspace-field-${field.path.replaceAll('.','-')}`} data-field={field.path} rows="3" maxlength={field.max||240} autocomplete="off" />:<input id={`workspace-field-${field.path.replaceAll('.','-')}`} data-field={field.path} type={field.type==='number'?'number':'text'} max={field.type==='number'?field.max:undefined} min={field.type==='number'?(field.min??0):undefined} maxlength={field.type!=='number'?field.max||240:undefined} step={field.type==='number'?'any':undefined} autocomplete="off" />}</div>)}</div></details>)}
      <p class="small">Use consistent currency and periods for all financial amounts. Blank fields remain unknown.</p><div class="workspace-metric" data-workspace-metric></div>
     </section>
     <section id="workspace-panel-claims" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="workspace-tab-claims" data-workspace-panel="claims" class="workspace-panel" hidden><div class="workspace-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep the qualification attached</p><h2>Facts &amp; claims</h2></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-add-claim>Add claim</button></div><p class="small">Record short statements and their source context. A status is your assessment; AI does not verify a claim.</p><div data-claim-list></div></section>
     <section id="workspace-panel-evidence" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="workspace-tab-evidence" data-workspace-panel="evidence" class="workspace-panel" hidden><div class="workspace-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">An adaptable tracker</p><h2>Evidence</h2></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-add-evidence>Add evidence item</button></div><p class="small">Track whether evidence is needed or has been reviewed by you. No documents are uploaded, and these statuses do not imply AI verification.</p><div data-evidence-list></div></section>
     <section id="workspace-panel-questions" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="workspace-tab-questions" data-workspace-panel="questions" class="workspace-panel" hidden><div class="workspace-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Make the next conversation useful</p><h2>Questions</h2></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-add-question>Add question</button></div><p class="small">Keep unanswered questions visible. Adding an AI suggestion never marks it answered.</p><div data-question-list></div></section>
     <section id="workspace-panel-actions" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="workspace-tab-actions" data-workspace-panel="actions" class="workspace-panel" hidden><div class="workspace-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Move the investigation forward</p><h2>Next actions</h2></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-add-action>Add action</button></div><p class="small">Choose concrete follow-ups. These are prompts for your judgment, not an investment recommendation.</p><div data-action-list></div></section>
     <section class="workspace-panel workspace-review" data-review-panel hidden aria-labelledby="workspace-review-heading"><p class="eyebrow">AI gap review</p><h2 id="workspace-review-heading">A second look at your summaries</h2><p class="small">An educational review of entered information. Reported claims remain unverified.</p><p class="workspace-stale" data-review-stale hidden></p><div data-review-sections></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-add-selected>Add selected questions &amp; actions</button><details data-review-sources-panel hidden><summary>Course concepts behind this review</summary><ul data-review-sources></ul></details></section>
    </div>
    <aside class="workspace-sidebar"><section class="workspace-card workspace-unknowns" aria-labelledby="workspace-unknowns-heading"><p class="eyebrow">What is still unknown</p><h2 id="workspace-unknowns-heading">Keep the gaps visible</h2><ul data-workspace-unknowns tabindex="0" aria-label="Unknowns and evidence gaps"></ul><p class="small">Missing information stays unknown. No values are inferred.</p></section><section class="workspace-card"><h2>Choose the next step</h2><p class="small">Review only when you are ready to send this deal’s sanitized summaries to the AI service.</p><button type="button" class="button" data-review-gaps>Review gaps</button><p class="small">Uses 1 of your 100 monthly Deal Lab requests. No automatic requests or retries.</p><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-open-coach>Open with Call Coach</button><p class="small">Preview the context first. Opening Coach does not request AI coaching.</p></section></aside>
   </div>
   <details class="workspace-privacy"><summary>Privacy, browser storage &amp; data controls</summary><p>Without browser saving, deal information stays in this page’s memory. If you explicitly save, sanitized deal information is stored in this browser using IndexedDB, under an opaque account namespace. That namespace is not encryption. Browser saves are not synced or suitable for confidential material. Shared browser profiles can expose saved information.</p><p>Only an explicit gap review sends the selected deal to the AI service. Explicit Call Coach transfers send only the context you approve between tabs. This workspace sends no analytics. AI requests use <code>store: false</code>; this is not a zero-retention guarantee. Service providers process requests under their own policies. <a href="/privacy/#ai-deal-lab">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>.</p><button type="button" class="workspace-text-button danger" data-clear-all>Delete all saved workspace data</button><p class="small">Deletes Deal Workspace saves for all accounts in this browser and clears deals open in workspace tabs. Other site and account data is untouched.</p></details>
  </div>
  <dialog data-workspace-confirm aria-labelledby="workspace-confirm-heading"><h2 id="workspace-confirm-heading" data-confirm-title></h2><p data-confirm-description></p><div class="workspace-controls"><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-confirm-cancel autofocus>Cancel</button><button type="button" class="button" data-confirm-accept>Delete deal</button></div></dialog>
  <dialog data-workspace-coach-dialog aria-labelledby="workspace-coach-heading"><h2 id="workspace-coach-heading">Send this context to Call Coach?</h2><p>Review these short summaries before opening a connected Coach tab. No AI request is made by opening it.</p><label for="workspace-coach-preview">Context to send</label><textarea id="workspace-coach-preview" data-workspace-coach-preview readonly rows="12"></textarea><div class="workspace-controls"><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-workspace-coach-cancel autofocus>Cancel</button><button type="button" class="button" data-workspace-coach-confirm>Open Call Coach</button></div></dialog>
 </div>
 <noscript><p class="notice">Deal Workspace needs JavaScript. The <a href="/course/">free course</a> is still available.</p></noscript>
 <script src="../../../scripts/deal-workspace.ts"></script>
</Base>
